From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Venus Build Fix <noreply@example.com>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 12:25:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] rpi_arm64: disable the u-boot logo/animation

CONFIG_VIDEO_LOGO defaults to y whenever CONFIG_SPLASH_SCREEN is unset
(see drivers/video/Kconfig), which this defconfig never sets, so
u-boot draws its logo on every boot. Stock VenusOS images on other
machines do not show this - disable it explicitly to match.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [Venus specific]

---
 configs/rpi_arm64_defconfig | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

--- a/configs/rpi_arm64_defconfig
+++ b/configs/rpi_arm64_defconfig
@@ -66,6 +66,7 @@
 # CONFIG_VIDEO_BPP16 is not set
 CONFIG_SYS_WHITE_ON_BLACK=y
 CONFIG_VIDEO_BCM2835=y
+# CONFIG_VIDEO_LOGO is not set
 CONFIG_CONSOLE_SCROLL_LINES=10
 CONFIG_PHYS_TO_BUS=y
 # CONFIG_HEXDUMP is not set
-- 
